@startuml st-waitlist
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam roundcorner 6

title State Machine Diagram — Waitlist Entity (7 States)

[*] --> WAITING : Customer joins waitlist when unit type capacity is 0\n[FIFO queue priority tracked by created_at]\n/ WaitlistService#registerWaitlist (BR-WAT-01)

WAITING --> CONTACTING : FM starts phone outreach to highest priority customer\n/ WaitlistService#startContacting (BR-WAT-02)
WAITING --> EXPIRED : Target desired start date has passed with no unit available\n/ WaitlistExpiryScheduler
WAITING --> CANCELLED : Customer proactively cancels waitlist entry from portal\n/ WaitlistService#cancelWaitlist

CONTACTING --> PENDING_FOLLOW_UP : Customer requests callback later or needs time to decide\n/ WaitlistService#markFollowUp
CONTACTING --> CONVERTED : Customer agrees to rent available unit\n[Converted into Reservation, unit held 2 hours]\n/ WaitlistService#convertToReservation (BR-WAT-03)
CONTACTING --> REJECTED : Customer declines offer or no longer needs storage\n/ WaitlistService#rejectOffer

PENDING_FOLLOW_UP --> CONTACTING : FM resumes follow-up call with customer\n/ WaitlistService#resumeContact
PENDING_FOLLOW_UP --> REJECTED : Customer declines after follow-up\n/ WaitlistService#rejectOffer
PENDING_FOLLOW_UP --> EXPIRED : Expiration date reached before confirmation\n/ WaitlistExpiryScheduler

CONVERTED --> [*]
REJECTED --> [*]
EXPIRED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]
@enduml

